T0 Price:** $342.42 [Actual \u2014 Aggregator quote 2026-08-24]\n**Basic Shares Outstanding:** 25,806,000 [Actual \u2014 vendor]\n**Market Cap (basic):** $8.836B [Actual \u2014 arithmetic]\n**Pro-forma fully-diluted shares:** \u224833.4M [Estimate \u2014 net shares after convertible conversion and warrant net-share settlement]\n**Basic to diluted delta:** 7.6M shares from 2027 converts (\u22483.4M net) and 6.0M warrants at $105.43 strike (\u22484.2M net) [Estimate]\n\n**Primary Archetype:** B \u2014 Quality Compounder (High ROIC, growing recurring revenue, net cash)\n**Valuation Engine:** Engine 1 (Traditional DCF + Multiples), with scenario overlay to capture licensing/legal optionality.\n**Fair Value (Base):** \u2248$195/share\n**Probability-Weighted Expected Value:** \u2248$200/share\n**Margin of Safety at $342.42:** **-75% (negative \u2014 price far above intrinsic value)**\n**Recommendation:** **HOLD if owned (trim into strength) / AVOID new initiation at T0**\n**Conviction Score:** **6/15 (Low)**\n\n**Key analytical tension:** The market price embeds near-certain confidence in management's 2030 targets ($1B ARR, $600M adjusted EBITDA) at a sub-8.0% discount rate. My base case \u2014 which assigns realistic probabilities to litigation (DOJ/Disney/Amazon), catch-up revenue contraction, and execution risk \u2014 yields fair value well below the current quote.\n\n\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\n## SECTION 1. MACRO CONTEXT\n\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u255